Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug is the incorrect order of variable declarations and assignments in the `src/mesa/main/uniforms.c` file. Specifically, the variable `shProg` was being used before it was declared, leading to syntax errors and undeclared identifier errors when compiling with the MSVC compiler. This violates C language rules regarding variable scope and declaration order, which require that variables be declared before they are used in any expressions or function calls.

